SetDisplayName (0, '%LFMao')
DisplayMessage (0, char, 0
「Phew… finally got all the unpacking done…」%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (1, char, 0
I bundled up the empty cardboard boxes and crushed them flat, letting out a sigh of relief as I said that.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (2, char, 0
It's been a month since we moved into this house, and now my room is finally sorted out―nice and tidy.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (3, char, 0
Between the move and transferring schools, everything was so hectic that I kept putting off unpacking, and it ended up taking this long to finish.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (4, char, 0
But now, I can finally relax in my own room…%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (5, char, 0
Before I knew it, it was starting to get dark outside the window. A lot of time had passed.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
SetDisplayName (0, '%LFMao')
DisplayMessage (6, char, 0
「Alright… now that unpacking's done, maybe I'll take a break and surf the net…」%K%P
);
