SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (7, char, 0
With that, I sat down in my chair and reached to turn on my computer.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (8, char, 0
The router had been buried in the moving boxes, and I'd only just found it today, finally getting internet connected.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (9, char, 0
Until now, I'd been stuck using my phone for everything online, so it felt like a huge relief to be free of that hassle.%K%P
);
