SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (23, char, 0
She's my dad's remarriage partner, and we're not blood-related, but I lost my real mom young and have no memory of her. By the time I was old enough to remember, Mami was raising me, so she's as good as my real mom.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (24, char, 0
Mami lost her first husband to an accident early on too, so she and my dad naturally bonded over their similar circumstances.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (25, char, 0
Then my dad passed away suddenly from illness a few years ago, and now Mami's holding the family together single-handedly. I feel like I need to step up and support her in his place.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (26, char, 0
Our family isn't well-off financially. We're scraping by on the little savings Dad left behind, and Mami's juggling multiple part-time jobs just to make ends meet.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (27, char, 0
We moved to this house because one of Mami's relatives, worried about our situation, offered us an empty property near their place for free. That's how we ended up here last month.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (28, char, 0
It's been tough in a lot of ways, but we're a family supporting each other as we start fresh in this new place…%K%P
);
