SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (35, char, 0
Her name is Amagi Miku―not someone I'm proud to call my sister.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (36, char, 0
She's Mami's daughter from her previous marriage. When we were little, she used to look after me and even bathe with me―she was my proud big sis back then. But as we grew up, we talked less and less, and now she just hurls snide remarks whenever we cross paths.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (37, char, 0
She's technically my sister, but since she's an early birthday baby in the year, we're in the same grade. I've never been okay with her high-and-mighty attitude, but speaking up would just set her off, so as the little brother, I grit my teeth and put up with it.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (38, char, 0
That said, she definitely inherited Mami's genes―her looks are undeniably cute. But whether it's her personality or the fact that she goes to an all-girls school, she hasn't had a boyfriend yet and seems pretty anxious about it.%K%P
);
SetDisplayName (0, '')
DisplayMessage (39, char, 0
Not that I have any room to talk―I've never had a girlfriend either…%K%P
);
